d with the understanding that 'probable' means probability ≥ 1/n. Thus, probable outcomes: A: -4000 (prob 0.8), B: -3000 (prob 1.0). Averages: A: -4000, B: -3000. Since -3000 > -4000, the reason prefers B.",
